; tools/contract/conformance-covered.x -- the ISA rows the conformance
; suite currently DEFINES.  Generated by tools/check/conformance-coverage.sh
; --update; do not hand-edit.
;
; A ratchet, not a target: coverage may grow freely, and a row that was
; covered and is no longer fails the gate.  The suite is early -- this file
; exists so that being early cannot be mistaken for being finished, and so
; that progress cannot silently reverse.
